  "ch4.detail.raw": "Fresh from frontend: stack slots and dead arithmetic clutter the IR.",
  "ch4.detail.sroa": "SROA promotes local stack variables into SSA registers, cutting memory traffic to 0.",
  "ch4.detail.instcombine": "InstCombine rewrites *2 to shl 1, collapses a-a to 0, and proves the branch false.",
